        "description": "The desktop app reports that its window gained the focus. The engine records the time in\nits run-file (`focused_at`), so an agent that does not say which engine it means gets the\none the person is looking at (`cutweave engines`, `docs/reference/launch-protocol.md`).\nUI credential only and never an MCP tool: it is the app applying its own state to the\nengine (ADR-0016). Not undoable, not journaled, never marks the project dirty.",
        "title": "ProjectReportFocus",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "journaled": false,
      "kind": "engine",
